{
  "story_id": "three-days-on-the-atoll",
  "chapter": 3,
  "total_duration_ms": 336888,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "On the second morning they woke early.",
      "start_ms": 1546,
      "end_ms": 4286
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "They ate coconut.",
      "start_ms": 4286,
      "end_ms": 5551
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "They walked around the island.",
      "start_ms": 5551,
      "end_ms": 7729
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "They did some maintenance on the fire — banking it, making sure the driftwood pile stayed dry.",
      "start_ms": 7729,
      "end_ms": 14404
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "They fished for lunch.",
      "start_ms": 14404,
      "end_ms": 16021
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Mala caught her first fish — a small silver reef fish, about the size of her hand.",
      "start_ms": 16021,
      "end_ms": 21853
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "She was very proud.",
      "start_ms": 21853,
      "end_ms": 23258
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Her father cooked it.",
      "start_ms": 23258,
      "end_ms": 24804
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "They ate it.",
      "start_ms": 24804,
      "end_ms": 25717
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "The day was slow.",
      "start_ms": 25717,
      "end_ms": 26982
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "The sun was hot at midday.",
      "start_ms": 26982,
      "end_ms": 28879
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "They rested in the shade of the palms.",
      "start_ms": 28879,
      "end_ms": 31690
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "In the afternoon her father worked on the motor.",
      "start_ms": 31690,
      "end_ms": 35133
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "He had not brought many tools but he was trying to at least understand what had failed.",
      "start_ms": 35133,
      "end_ms": 41316
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "He took it apart, piece by piece, laying every part carefully on a piece of cloth.",
      "start_ms": 41316,
      "end_ms": 47148
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "He said, \"There is a small part inside the fuel line that has broken.",
      "start_ms": 47148,
      "end_ms": 52067
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "I cannot fix it here.",
      "start_ms": 52067,
      "end_ms": 53613
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "But when we get back I know what to buy.",
      "start_ms": 53613,
      "end_ms": 56493
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Fine.",
      "start_ms": 56493,
      "end_ms": 56915
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "So we know.\"",
      "start_ms": 56915,
      "end_ms": 57899
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "That evening they watched the sea.",
      "start_ms": 57899,
      "end_ms": 60358
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "No boat came.",
      "start_ms": 60358,
      "end_ms": 61342
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Her father said, \"They will come.",
      "start_ms": 61342,
      "end_ms": 63731
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Do not worry.",
      "start_ms": 63731,
      "end_ms": 64714
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Tomorrow probably.",
      "start_ms": 64714,
      "end_ms": 66050
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Aunt Teuea will be very worried.",
      "start_ms": 66050,
      "end_ms": 68368
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "The harbor patrol is thorough.",
      "start_ms": 68368,
      "end_ms": 70547
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "They know where I fish.",
      "start_ms": 70547,
      "end_ms": 72233
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "They will send someone to check the reef and the small atolls in this area.",
      "start_ms": 72233,
      "end_ms": 77573
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "It is a straightforward search.",
      "start_ms": 77573,
      "end_ms": 79822
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Tomorrow.",
      "start_ms": 79822,
      "end_ms": 80524
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Maybe the day after.",
      "start_ms": 80524,
      "end_ms": 82000
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "We are fine.\"",
      "start_ms": 82000,
      "end_ms": 83054
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "That second night Mala was quieter.",
      "start_ms": 83054,
      "end_ms": 85583
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "She had been thinking about what her father had told her.",
      "start_ms": 85583,
      "end_ms": 89659
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "It had — settled in her, in a way.",
      "start_ms": 89659,
      "end_ms": 92118
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "She lay on the sand beside him and looked up at the stars.",
      "start_ms": 92118,
      "end_ms": 96264
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "She said, \"Papa.",
      "start_ms": 96264,
      "end_ms": 97458
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "I have thought about what you said.",
      "start_ms": 97458,
      "end_ms": 99988
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "About what to do if you died.",
      "start_ms": 99988,
      "end_ms": 102096
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "I want to tell you what I decided.\" Her father said, \"Okay.",
      "start_ms": 102096,
      "end_ms": 106312
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Tell me.\"",
      "start_ms": 106312,
      "end_ms": 106944
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "\"I think I want to go to secondary school.",
      "start_ms": 106944,
      "end_ms": 109530
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "And I think I want to try for the scholarship.",
      "start_ms": 109530,
      "end_ms": 112357
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "I have been thinking about it for a while, actually.",
      "start_ms": 112357,
      "end_ms": 115545
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "I did not know how to ask you.",
      "start_ms": 115545,
      "end_ms": 117410
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "I did not want you to think I wanted to leave.",
      "start_ms": 117410,
      "end_ms": 120236
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "But — I think I want to try.",
      "start_ms": 120236,
      "end_ms": 121981
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "I want to be a — I do not know yet — but maybe a doctor.",
      "start_ms": 121981,
      "end_ms": 125409
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "There are not enough doctors in Tarawa.",
      "start_ms": 125409,
      "end_ms": 127815
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "We had to fly to Fiji when Grandmother needed her operation.",
      "start_ms": 127815,
      "end_ms": 131484
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "That should not have to happen.",
      "start_ms": 131484,
      "end_ms": 133409
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "I want to be able to help people in Kiribati without them having to leave.",
      "start_ms": 133409,
      "end_ms": 137920
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "That is what I want.\"",
      "start_ms": 137920,
      "end_ms": 139303
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Her father was silent for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 139303,
      "end_ms": 141468
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Then he said, in a voice that was slightly rough, \"Mala.",
      "start_ms": 141468,
      "end_ms": 144897
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "I did not know you had thought that far.",
      "start_ms": 144897,
      "end_ms": 147363
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "I am so proud of you.",
      "start_ms": 147363,
      "end_ms": 148686
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "That is a beautiful plan.",
      "start_ms": 148686,
      "end_ms": 150250
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "I will support you every step of the way.",
      "start_ms": 150250,
      "end_ms": 152776
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "And I will help you save for it.",
      "start_ms": 152776,
      "end_ms": 154761
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Whatever it takes.\" Mala said, \"Papa.",
      "start_ms": 154761,
      "end_ms": 157046
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Please do not die before I finish.",
      "start_ms": 157046,
      "end_ms": 159152
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Please.",
      "start_ms": 159152,
      "end_ms": 159633
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "I want you to see me become a doctor.\" Her father laughed — a wet laugh — and said, \"I will do my best, Mala.",
      "start_ms": 159633,
      "end_ms": 166249
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "I will do my very best.\"",
      "start_ms": 166249,
      "end_ms": 167813
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "The harbor patrol boat came the next morning at about ten.",
      "start_ms": 167813,
      "end_ms": 171361
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Mala saw it first.",
      "start_ms": 171361,
      "end_ms": 172504
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "She had been watching the horizon.",
      "start_ms": 172504,
      "end_ms": 174609
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "She saw a small dark shape approaching from the direction of Tarawa.",
      "start_ms": 174609,
      "end_ms": 178759
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "She shouted, \"Papa.",
      "start_ms": 178759,
      "end_ms": 179962
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Papa.",
      "start_ms": 179962,
      "end_ms": 180323
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "There.\" Her father saw it.",
      "start_ms": 180323,
      "end_ms": 181947
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "He ran to the signal fire.",
      "start_ms": 181947,
      "end_ms": 183571
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "He lit it — the fire produced a lot of thick white smoke, because he had been keeping green palm fronds ready to throw on it.",
      "start_ms": 183571,
      "end_ms": 191150
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "The smoke rose high.",
      "start_ms": 191150,
      "end_ms": 192413
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "The boat changed course.",
      "start_ms": 192413,
      "end_ms": 193916
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "It came straight for them.",
      "start_ms": 193916,
      "end_ms": 195601
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "It was Uncle Beteru — Aunt Teuea's husband — and one of the men from the harbor patrol.",
      "start_ms": 195601,
      "end_ms": 200894
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "They pulled up to the beach.",
      "start_ms": 200894,
      "end_ms": 202638
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "They were relieved.",
      "start_ms": 202638,
      "end_ms": 203841
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Uncle Beteru got out and hugged both Mala and her father hard, and then hugged them again.",
      "start_ms": 203841,
      "end_ms": 209314
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "He said, \"Teuea is having a heart attack from worry.",
      "start_ms": 209314,
      "end_ms": 212502
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "We have been looking for you since yesterday morning.",
      "start_ms": 212502,
      "end_ms": 215750
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "We have been to five other atolls first.",
      "start_ms": 215750,
      "end_ms": 218216
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "This was the last one we were going to check today.\" Her father said, \"Motor.",
      "start_ms": 218216,
      "end_ms": 222907
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Broken.",
      "start_ms": 222907,
      "end_ms": 223388
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "We are fine.",
      "start_ms": 223388,
      "end_ms": 224170
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Very fine.\"",
      "start_ms": 224170,
      "end_ms": 224832
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "They towed the fishing boat back to Tarawa.",
      "start_ms": 224832,
      "end_ms": 227800
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "It took most of the afternoon.",
      "start_ms": 227800,
      "end_ms": 229892
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Mala stood at the bow of her father's boat with him.",
      "start_ms": 229892,
      "end_ms": 233467
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "She watched the small atoll get smaller and smaller until it was just a tiny green speck on the horizon and then nothing.",
      "start_ms": 233467,
      "end_ms": 241698
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "She said, \"Papa.",
      "start_ms": 241698,
      "end_ms": 242845
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "I want to remember this.",
      "start_ms": 242845,
      "end_ms": 244531
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "This was one of the best three days of my life.\" Her father laughed and said, \"Even the second night when there was no boat.\" \"Yes,\" said Mala.",
      "start_ms": 244531,
      "end_ms": 254246
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "\"Even the second night.",
      "start_ms": 254246,
      "end_ms": 255865
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "That was the best one, actually.",
      "start_ms": 255865,
      "end_ms": 258091
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Because you told me things.\"",
      "start_ms": 258091,
      "end_ms": 260115
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "They got home before dark.",
      "start_ms": 260115,
      "end_ms": 261937
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Aunt Teuea was crying at the pier when they arrived.",
      "start_ms": 261937,
      "end_ms": 265512
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "She hugged Mala until Mala could not breathe.",
      "start_ms": 265512,
      "end_ms": 268615
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Mala's father told everyone the story of what had happened.",
      "start_ms": 268615,
      "end_ms": 272663
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Everyone was fine.",
      "start_ms": 272663,
      "end_ms": 273945
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Everyone was safe.",
      "start_ms": 273945,
      "end_ms": 275227
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Mala's father spent the next two weeks fixing the motor.",
      "start_ms": 275227,
      "end_ms": 279072
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Mala went back to school on Monday.",
      "start_ms": 279072,
      "end_ms": 281501
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "She told nobody at school what had happened.",
      "start_ms": 281501,
      "end_ms": 284537
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "She kept it as her own.",
      "start_ms": 284537,
      "end_ms": 286156
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "But that year she started studying harder than she ever had.",
      "start_ms": 286156,
      "end_ms": 290271
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "When she was seventeen, she got the scholarship.",
      "start_ms": 290271,
      "end_ms": 293577
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "She went to Auckland to study medicine.",
      "start_ms": 293577,
      "end_ms": 296275
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Her father was still alive.",
      "start_ms": 296275,
      "end_ms": 298164
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "He was very proud.",
      "start_ms": 298164,
      "end_ms": 299446
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "He drove her — or, well, he came with her on the plane — to Auckland.",
      "start_ms": 299446,
      "end_ms": 304168
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "He hugged her at the airport.",
      "start_ms": 304168,
      "end_ms": 306192
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "He said, \"Remember the atoll, Mala.",
      "start_ms": 306192,
      "end_ms": 308621
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Remember what you decided.\" She said, \"I remember, Papa.\" And she went off to school.",
      "start_ms": 308621,
      "end_ms": 314423
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "She became a doctor.",
      "start_ms": 314423,
      "end_ms": 315840
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "She came back to Tarawa.",
      "start_ms": 315840,
      "end_ms": 317526
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Her father lived until she was thirty-four.",
      "start_ms": 317526,
      "end_ms": 320494
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "He got to see her set up a small clinic in Bikenibeu.",
      "start_ms": 320494,
      "end_ms": 324137
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "He died in his sleep.",
      "start_ms": 324137,
      "end_ms": 325622
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Mala took his ashes back to the small nameless atoll and spread them on the beach where they had watched the stars together.",
      "start_ms": 325622,
      "end_ms": 334055
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "That was the whole thing.",
      "start_ms": 334055,
      "end_ms": 335809
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "That was enough.",
      "start_ms": 335809,
      "end_ms": 336888
    }
  ]
}